## Running Tests

Run tests with vitest:

```bash
# Run all tests
bun run test

# Watch mode
bun run test:watch

# Run specific file
bunx vitest run tests/user.test.ts

# Run tests matching pattern
bunx vitest run -t "UserService"
```

